  "description": "Cypher query builder is a lightweight and intuitive C# library (fluent api) designed to construct Cypher queries programmatically for use with Neo4j graph database. It simplifies query creation by providing a fluent and type-safe API, allowing developers to focus on query logic rather than string concatenation.",
